  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/Final2funWeekKidsUsOnda.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(85,85,85); line-height: 21px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Este viernes ha terminado la segunda &#39;fun week&#39; del verano en Kids&amp;Us Onda School of english, que las albergar&aacute; durante todo el mes de julio en el centro de la plaza Corts Valencianes, 9. Como en la primera quincena, ni&ntilde;os y ni&ntilde;as de 3 a 10 a&ntilde;os, en dos grupos, han ofrecido un espect&aacute;culo final a padres y madres.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(85,85,85); line-height: 21px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalsegonafunweekkidsandusonda/final2funweekkidsusonda.jpg\" alt=\"final2funweekkidsusonda\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalsegonafunweekkidsandusonda/img_9900.jpg\" alt=\"img_9900\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalsegonafunweekkidsandusonda/img_9901.jpg\" alt=\"img_9901\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalsegonafunweekkidsandusonda/img_9902.jpg\" alt=\"img_9902\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalsegonafunweekkidsandusonda/img_9903.jpg\" alt=\"img_9903\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalsegonafunweekkidsandusonda/img_9904.jpg\" alt=\"img_9904\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalsegonafunweekkidsanduso